translate simplified_chinese a02_comn_07_a36342d0:



    voice "HIN_0407"
    hina "「真的？太好了！正好我肚子也饿了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a02_comn_07_07bbc502:


    "刚睡醒就起来。精神恢复得还是一如既往的快。"


translate simplified_chinese a02_comn_07_df5c18c0:



    voice "FUM_0301"
    fumi "「还有这是夏目同学的2：8的咖啡欧蕾」"


translate simplified_chinese a02_comn_07_9033fb83:



    voice "HIN_0408"
    hina "「很好，这样就能一直清醒到明天早上了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a02_comn_07_d6297796:


    "是不是太勉强了。"


translate simplified_chinese a02_comn_07_15f35988:



    voice "RIN_0350"
    rin "「谢谢，我开动了」"


translate simplified_chinese a02_comn_07_5dd5a089:



    voice "FUM_0302"
    fumi "「嗯，快喝吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a02_comn_07_dfdeb022:



    voice "HIN_0409"
    hina "「啊，暖暖的真好吃，是不是稍微烤了一下？」"


translate simplified_chinese a02_comn_07_82c8d86b:


    "把三明治放入嘴中的阳菜绽开了笑容。"


translate simplified_chinese a02_comn_07_29da5cc2:



    voice "RIN_0351"
    rin "「吃个夜宵还这么讲究啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a02_comn_07_3fcbc3d1:


    "稍作休息，文一脸微笑地看着伦和阳菜一口一口吃着三明治。"


translate simplified_chinese a02_comn_07_b875fe5a:



    voice "HIN_0410"
    hina "「咦？浅生不吃吗？要没了哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a02_comn_07_5e426c2f:



    voice "FUM_0303"
    fumi "「虽然我做是做了，但这个时间还吃东西会发胖，就有点犹豫」"


translate simplified_chinese a02_comn_07_da515acf:



    voice "RIN_0352"
    rin "「唔，你在减肥吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a02_comn_07_d12d43ed:



