    rin "「而且啊，肉都长该长的部位了，不是挺好的吗～」"


translate simplified_chinese a02_comn_07_8e2b00a1:



    voice "FUM_0309"
    fumi "「呀啊！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a02_comn_07_f045bcba:


